{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_cae83b625e1e","title":"小众软件","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NDMwMTI2MA==&mid=2651704921&idx=1&sn=1d1c0cd8adb50ecfec4da05eb29658be&chksm=bc835efa040a001058ed3c39082299ccb3a27281f8c53ca2c2e6178f9770b5aa7342f9ae4023&scene=126&sessionid=1795679874#rd","description":"推荐有灵魂的电脑软件、手机应用。","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"小众软件","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FQ3auHgzwzM5oB1jblgiarD8aOiaYBeEPnOE9DyicmmBJXIdUHFNC0h8MA%2F0","updated":"2026-11-26T04:34:46.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MjM5NDMwMTI2MA%3D%3D:2651704921:1","title":"经典游戏集体复活！1200多款游戏已被移植","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NDMwMTI2MA==&mid=2651704921&idx=1&sn=1d1c0cd8adb50ecfec4da05eb29658be&chksm=bc835efa040a001058ed3c39082299ccb3a27281f8c53ca2c2e6178f9770b5aa7342f9ae4023&scene=126&sessionid=1795679874#rd","description":"PlayPorted 是一个专门收集游戏移植项目的网站。\n\n它专门收录由粉丝们重制的主机游戏和经典PC游戏，让老游戏可以在现代电脑或者网页上原生运行。有些游戏还添加了宽屏、高帧率、MOD 或者现代的操作方式。\n\n截至 2026 年 11 月 26 日，它已经收录了来自 39 种原始平台的 2509 个移植项目，涉及 1220 款游戏，其中 1071 个项目已标记为可玩，还有 149 个浏览器移植项目。\n\n更多介绍：https://www.appinn.com/playported/\n项目主页：https://playported.com/","content":"<p>PlayPorted 是一个专门收集游戏移植项目的网站。<br /><br />它专门收录由粉丝们重制的主机游戏和经典PC游戏，让老游戏可以在现代电脑或者网页上原生运行。有些游戏还添加了宽屏、高帧率、MOD 或者现代的操作方式。<br /><br />截至 2026 年 11 月 26 日，它已经收录了来自 39 种原始平台的 2509 个移植项目，涉及 1220 款游戏，其中 1071 个项目已标记为可玩，还有 149 个浏览器移植项目。<br /><br />更多介绍：https://www.appinn.com/playported/<br />项目主页：https://playported.com/</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxclmLU4GNIfpmzoexp9ib3lntRDPcN8VufNHfb2e1k70kZXGkPXdPiciazwzXRWSbPrh83WhDhKGdBn5pKBic9GuzGzxra0WiamVarc%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxcuibm8I73ic7A7y5v99wTKJTicXIf9BsInQQ9EOnkYvlT412AffzUjCC6u9U5gfK63J1IpaW8lFiaVwnOz5BsQbIP4I7C5864JI88%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxeXlcNu5kVarvImTykvp3lJUI9vE39RtZw6w3m3fGmp2jF1VicC7BJEJlRSqSN1EHnLArQPsdYicgicj2iaOJibTmqzOulSkfKlgPmA%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FTs4Edaib9xxexKlia6KfK0ziaK71QK7PuHPibhKR6k133Wsm0hM6ocdibibrqYxkFY3YibLGicBCTWEN2Uds3OrribrGut7Ir6XpFhTXfOjJNoj7VY2U%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxclmLU4GNIfpmzoexp9ib3lntRDPcN8VufNHfb2e1k70kZXGkPXdPiciazwzXRWSbPrh83WhDhKGdBn5pKBic9GuzGzxra0WiamVarc%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxcuibm8I73ic7A7y5v99wTKJTicXIf9BsInQQ9EOnkYvlT412AffzUjCC6u9U5gfK63J1IpaW8lFiaVwnOz5BsQbIP4I7C5864JI88%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxeXlcNu5kVarvImTykvp3lJUI9vE39RtZw6w3m3fGmp2jF1VicC7BJEJlRSqSN1EHnLArQPsdYicgicj2iaOJibTmqzOulSkfKlgPmA%2F0"],"type":"gallery","published":"2026-11-26T04:34:46.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MjM5NDMwMTI2MA%3D%3D:2651704906:1","title":"1Password 遭黑客入侵，部分用户数据泄露","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NDMwMTI2MA==&mid=2651704906&idx=1&sn=867f45f2c64dcc7430900b0a64199f92&chksm=bcaad0f4648c548f5291ecf86527b47298246e2f111ca7fcad12edfcf8ad408452a03671177d&scene=126&sessionid=1795679874#rd","description":"11 月 25 日，知名密码管理器 1Password 发布安全公告<a class=\"wx_img_refer_link\" data-seq=\"3\" data-refer=\"图3\" style=\"\">图3</a>，确认黑客通过一名员工的企业 GitHub 账号入侵内部系统，植入恶意代码，窃取了部分用户的姓名、邮箱、账户 ID 等信息，同时获取了私有源代码及 CI/CD 系统访问权限。\n\n官方称<a class=\"wx_img_refer_link\" data-seq=\"4\" data-refer=\"图4\" style=\"\">图4</a>，用户的密码保险库及其中保存的所有内容、主密码、Secret Key、客户端和浏览器扩展均未受到影响，用户无需修改密码，但应警惕冒充 1Password 的钓鱼邮件、账户恢复请求及诈骗电话。\n\n目前，受影响的用户总数尚未公布。","content":"<p>11 月 25 日，知名密码管理器 1Password 发布安全公告&lt;a class=&quot;wx_img_refer_link&quot; data-seq=&quot;3&quot; data-refer=&quot;图3&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;图3&lt;/a&gt;，确认黑客通过一名员工的企业 GitHub 账号入侵内部系统，植入恶意代码，窃取了部分用户的姓名、邮箱、账户 ID 等信息，同时获取了私有源代码及 CI/CD 系统访问权限。<br /><br />官方称&lt;a class=&quot;wx_img_refer_link&quot; data-seq=&quot;4&quot; data-refer=&quot;图4&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;图4&lt;/a&gt;，用户的密码保险库及其中保存的所有内容、主密码、Secret Key、客户端和浏览器扩展均未受到影响，用户无需修改密码，但应警惕冒充 1Password 的钓鱼邮件、账户恢复请求及诈骗电话。<br /><br />目前，受影响的用户总数尚未公布。</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxc9tAIF1Cic4WbJzWVXJTVPicUOic0z6s2Vr6icNozsm3pmZ1k1eozKyzpZtOpyibNASyQLpWXliasKNZEIco8QryrFcO0s7UzwexBibI%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxdNkEzveHVeZ1RBdnMA0fKrPib7yMiaW5IL1IhWs3uYyBB8gsyKeLyb9CB8clKjG2Kcr8bUa6xBQoKkkib3HAoZR2uVV9X3tOWicbc%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxcW7jjQ8ghq9zudBIficFoJ6hI2Ea2LdDgy3BJ6T2r05wW8tTXKAFWZxuibrkicumR97I4453Burm1xrnP8PzYq33Le3PdO9uodpI%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxdeqcvxgOF124uEGWFwiaVeYC6mFoNhIINuibUgxSE78SWv85AFnOg1cr8pySngRD9lklibNchSurvecE7w1sSPSDN9t5AOREpndU%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FTs4Edaib9xxdoDZzYoGlLicNVxLCGuzSDEWmtt6MLf3QXdGarDuAhr85Q8ScrLAl5Wja9a7ez00jpHcclibibib0ibtg3ModaCoETDTk2VqRiciadO8%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%